254	                <div class="pipeline-detail" id="pipeline-step-5"><p><strong>Phase and action recognition.</strong> A temporal model combines recent frames to recognize the phase of the operation, such as dissection, and the action under way, such as retracting tissue.</p><div class="pipeline-models"><span>Example models</span><ul><li>TCN</li><li>LSTM</li><li>Transformer</li></ul></div></div>
